{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1364,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a3bac31f12a82debff10a828",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "くうぅ～…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dea469e2bbd03ab0bba6a66481b3c6cfd7bd155810c5a7c294663e2d20c02b42",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1054",
        "140018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:76d5d31253b128c495b17872",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "明日はこれだ！\r\n忘れずに取りに来いよなっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "48a2ee28b283626fd5db816f0f15fc2acd3ed4cec77e38a1b8304904456d8ed6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1054",
        "15"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c91b2acbc12d9c6c4c350524",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ううぅ～、カロテンエネルギーが\r\n切れそうだ…！でも、でも、\r\nヒーローは、倒れないっ…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ff22514458cfb626f2fc2fdaf018b60d656c0d81be9eb3f9a851ac534f5b2156",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1054",
        "20000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:666333c05da54d46fb87460d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "はあぁぁぁ～…ベジー博士の\r\n『栄養ポーション』が…欲しいぞ…",
      "source_fingerprint": "8edb983dbb438b4d9fbc17cd6c0c418f9ced7d08ec99b642ce3783e12f106b0d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1054",
        "20001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0586e2853ba15fe9dbb6896e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ビシバシッ！ズバーンッ！\r\n今日のアタシは最強だっ！\r\nどんな戦いにも負けないっ！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b080c94716f1232e5cc8d1639d65c91e6ffa71fd8ce5975db1f522f2be9b7d14",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1054",
        "20002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6410babf5708e10e4b1bf4a1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "うおおぉっ！やるぞぉーー！！\r\nペガサスマッハストラーイクッ！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5f5206eec138d10e746220756c5603bbae5c125717f365d2421cf7eae51c8c08",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1054",
        "20003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8f1abdbb4a09fbb96b31fdab",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "厳しいトレーニングだって、\r\nやっつけてやる！\r\nさあ！かかってこいっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ac23fe8e7cf22079401966a50169bbadcb902a3278cfd8df21babf1d8eee208",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1054",
        "20004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a57c84466c3c960e3fc9a93c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "なにがあっても諦めない心が\r\nアタシを強くしていくんだっ！\r\n今日もがんばるぞっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "97fb154a7ad67c9dd1091abb74832cf97ab7aff36dcdb2edd9e7162680126cf8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1054",
        "20005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e8d1a3441dd69d8b1fa9676d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "トレーナー長官、作戦指示を頼む。\r\nこのジャスティス・ビコーが、\r\n正義のために必ず遂行しよう！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f11930ba9fe4778688a8d5613d304ac110744613dd8c4867b1bbc54dbafde7ff",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1054",
        "20006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9c44602644b3d87c06bb7cd2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ヒーローは平和な日にこそ人知れず\r\nトレーニングしてるものなんだ。\r\nもちろん、アタシもだっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d716a7c1e2a7b70c7ae58075e00618d28372ab5e5f6b68122b28951872b670a0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1054",
        "20007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a583acbc17cd05f728cb81f4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ううぅ～～！今日のアタシ、\r\nなーんか、ふぬけてる気がする。\r\nこんなんじゃ、ダメなのに…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9db871869aa2045f6eb1742df3cbb77056d51ef3ab54e9c0fb0ec6951fd923c3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1054",
        "20008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c9b7b08ec77a87a9f79710ff",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ピカピカじゃない日も、がんばる。\r\n…それがヒーローだよな。",
      "source_fingerprint": "322734b621ec31855492966d60ed5fb458bee4880a179e85fec794b35ffefcd2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1054",
        "20009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c3a24161f7177a70aa3ea31b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "なあ…ちょっとだけ、\r\nキャロットマンごっこしないか…？\r\nトレーニングは…あとでやるから。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6c009b38611a6863fa6f0342d53727e07648224b2903a2b50f91fb3a5d23ef1e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1054",
        "20010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:de6a83c5f9be9b9a81e1afc0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ぼーっとしちゃ、ダメだ…。\r\n集中、集中…………ううぅ～～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b0446db08f71d4862e03ff3616a330f6953f309b2b556a183c89c13bf34f8960",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1054",
        "20011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:393f5e77b5f3413dc478d4d9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "またレースか？\r\nエネルギー切れに\r\nなったら困るぞ…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "823c2b51675c7dff847acd8fa560e1a830cd4ee7ba5c8d5380bf96644e26bd74",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1054",
        "20021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6247cd3a1d41440e3b8d13db",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "待ったっ！キャロットマンだって、\r\n連続バトルのあとは補給しないと\r\n戦えないんだぞ！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "130bf5bb6e58c46d740a65690b9605339367361cec9ff95424495a9cd08aae7a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1054",
        "20022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:725d6edf0ed31be502d1792e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "シャキーン☆正義の味方、\r\nジャスティス・ビコー、参上っ！\r\nヒーローは、必ず勝ーーつ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "58ab7735e23e21873515516d732432ad412dbebf2b8bc965058ba2b7ae976d7c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1054",
        "20023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e3283596666087cf45c06d2e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ジャジャジャッ！ジャジャーン！\r\n――『正義のための熱き戦いが、\r\n今始まる…！！』",
      "source_fingerprint": "d59b5a21adf68828b00afe4f046e2d13aad0f99060dabc15f8d5d680c2737af3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1054",
        "20024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:969d2f2fe8e0ff8f616b9cc2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "勝ってくるぞ、トレーナー！\r\nアタシがヒーローになるとこ、\r\n見逃さないようになっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7ae128bb2f1a7c0d3f1127e9ed77b5cecfd189e602115808b0376b9afef4fbb5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1054",
        "20025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6ba906557ccab2d63b0fb470",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行くぞっ！よい子のみんなに、\r\n勇気と希望を届けるんだっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c07286cb21fe16eebc105142ce6e75595464796abe0ec777e5b4cbd0f88d36f0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1054",
        "20026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:865f8ea79caa149719780047",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "おかげで調整はばっちりだぞ！\r\nとっても体が軽いんだ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a84c28081a4047c7d2391402cbb668eb27e88711c3fa815bdf65f4f0c4971cf6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1054",
        "20027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9c2c112ca195c336e59b14ce",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "負けないぞっ！今日はアタシが\r\nヒーローになるんだっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "916d27fc63a3ea4534cad37a863771fb52e4a7a7ef189f0759fcc16c824b787f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1054",
        "20028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f3599c7acc738c89bb230b1f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "特訓の成果を出せるように\r\nいっぱいがんばってくるからな！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6ded2ad61ebd090aead91462b34a535d846a6d46268801cb3d6a9add7da48225",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1054",
        "20029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f11e3ea955ac3eb28c167d3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ヒーローとして、\r\nカッコ悪い走りは見せられない。\r\n気合い入れていくぞ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9d5d01310ec9df589002bda55709c3e369bf07f68b5f1d16cea11f4d74f08ec2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1054",
        "20030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:48468ae201e3bdf7e8b30a42",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "フルパワーで勝負だ。\r\n必殺技をビシッとキメてやる！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0ee9318ec679af8b2151d8ff12f263a2b9df513983b02ce24b617788c1a063ed",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1054",
        "20031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5e7f8c01189cedd1b53273a3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "調子悪い日に限って戦いが始まる。\r\nヒーローものでもよくあるな。\r\nうん…アタシも、がんばらないと。",
      "source_fingerprint": "362c219d93d3cd32dbe3246f7071fe3f1d4382c22c16b272752eded38cfed0f8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1054",
        "20032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3c76be32b57b7a48f39721e8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "『ジャスティス・ビコー、危うし』\r\nでも、こういう回は土壇場で\r\n新しい力が目覚めるはずなんだ…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "474cbb82c0500e8109c6abd814262a523fd1c146e887884ae13bc85943dee404",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1054",
        "20033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cd3e439dbb9c788b46430d4d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "こんな調子で勝てるのかな…？\r\n…いや、勝つんだ！ピンチに\r\nキメるのがヒーローだ…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c4546bef6f9f29844a694688b34aaf464b8bcddbbc2f8464b1f3ed1ee770bb31",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1054",
        "20034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0fdc5d77447dc6dbad9734f6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "くうぅ、大ピンチだ…\r\nでも、ここから逆転するのが、\r\nヒーロー…の、はず…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d64f547cb7f4e8bae3f482a93d7b95ab55879fd243aad336208af74ea83fd850",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1054",
        "20035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bbd4173777166f967d5becf7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "くそう、弱気じゃダメだぁ～っ…！\r\nこんなんじゃ、カッコ悪いぞ…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "73c1c467b7d3389812436c0bb005e301275208369b5b70e7aea9735a10ae58a8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1054",
        "20036"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cfbd2e6abfe01389f6c3caff",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "できることをやるしかない。\r\nだって、諦めることだけは、\r\nしたくないんだ…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bc5cc9a31722755f575ef4ac1e8f5fcff1d3a7e9d2bba05f5984a7e33cb7b70d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1054",
        "20037"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:13eb2e5256dc8271b536b0ad",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "とうっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "03b1a766dc00f2d12cde4e247e9154fa3dea1156830d1f224bc885e67280f871",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1054",
        "20038"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4033ae9e59f94baea738ebc7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "てやぁっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c83ed0bd610b817297bf46914a907ed1e692ece823ad30ebb9516139e5918292",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1054",
        "20039"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:feed919ab212a8ff60a6d511",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行くぞっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "234fc468f038728a6ff68f52dd301bb2ff71b3d4f251b6c1ff7d1dffa4a9f970",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1054",
        "20040"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:05163a3c32ff80256bf1b504",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "むむむ～っ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8ddbb5c6ffa9fc8f33751fd24d0584098fd57e7fd4df4b4ea14ee20f42a4b8c3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1054",
        "20041"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:695a82b382fbc81664651e1d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "うわーっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c18f6ec4983ce93d04b7374c5de6e8a0c278b3919216e820596b23f1e5320660",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1054",
        "20042"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6532008bd11e4384ffddbb9b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "むうぅ～…？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a38c2d10654060509577e55c56b46f8f282f4621413151bfbbae8cf9d747a4ee",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1054",
        "20043"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:04c29dc5d19f8b4c1e09fdfc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "パトロールだ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a81a1df0486ac69cb6ac37b4f93aaa2a4abef97124b957e62726ec6a02a3450d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1054",
        "20046"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:93adcd11bd2c6bf0947ee875",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "海だ～！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "98356e117486509a8a4d1950294b35311b9f90701f7701c649dd44bf7267ffa7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1054",
        "20047"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eb86db62dd62930570281392",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "これからも、共に戦おうっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ccd14ed930f90e4ffd4940200d2873fbdb2f2e6560ab8efd3f9f9ca8bb2d8f17",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1054",
        "20049"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f94652cf27efc5a41f25c88c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "応援、ありがとな～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3f3925db8a2cdc3f3e9b534f4822bfa1fe14efc5069b1802852b9782cce4c709",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1054",
        "20050"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:10d4d0929d4ebec80a2d391c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来练习合体技啦──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "838be2d769c003cf3dd20fe8824121fb907064cca2f1119897cd3a6d1e76cf4b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1054",
        "20051"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:128086cdb812013bb3537ef8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "出動だー！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7ce1f8c17b648079306a59b4a2efe6ed0c9e65ce9543091a7b641b4fe1bad998",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1054",
        "2030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e1a21dbd4d6c65c8022a8ef0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "力を合わせて！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8be250539ac2e9d53a77bacab4e3dddcdf449d45e87def3eed8110ce6cfe5473",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1054",
        "2031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3f13b385f69ca449ca8b90d3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "応援、ありがとな～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3f3925db8a2cdc3f3e9b534f4822bfa1fe14efc5069b1802852b9782cce4c709",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1054",
        "2032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5a5c0994dc8fdbb37ff36af4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "負けないぞっ！今日はアタシが\r\nヒーローになるんだっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "916d27fc63a3ea4534cad37a863771fb52e4a7a7ef189f0759fcc16c824b787f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1054",
        "2033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6eb279926e5b547369cbe82c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "勝ってくるぞ、トレーナー！\r\nアタシがヒーローになるとこ、\r\n見逃さないようになっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7ae128bb2f1a7c0d3f1127e9ed77b5cecfd189e602115808b0376b9afef4fbb5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1054",
        "2034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:63fb6a038a3b599a01c22727",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "応援、ありがとな～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3f3925db8a2cdc3f3e9b534f4822bfa1fe14efc5069b1802852b9782cce4c709",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1054",
        "2035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5f7381da2badcd56557e6a4a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "とうっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "03b1a766dc00f2d12cde4e247e9154fa3dea1156830d1f224bc885e67280f871",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1054",
        "23015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:49e95be81b1e0e34b0f92bc5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "惜しい！もう少しだったな！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fcd7647b0662c6ede272027fbdd1c380650ae37f0db9deca1d23930f1d1102b6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1054",
        "30000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:84dcf34936fe374342b5abec",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "次こそ勝つ！挑戦し続けるのがヒーローだ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cbfb3e3a43cc4d1b67fc386a77ad9d8938d5116967148645728c4237e819efe5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1054",
        "30001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc4d35d5cff417faa1507692",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "くっ！情けないぞ、ジャスティス・ビコー…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e29e5bc70c5d1bd4e32068a93a7e187556a5370b082386d31964a1f1161215b4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1054",
        "30002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5883cd98e98e6e11a269e169",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "鍛え直すぞ…アタシの戦いはまだ続くんだ…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5ef891a2f13f2f9ed96fb8df24690cae1b8497e972edf77b3da6393840afd20f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1054",
        "30003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:58dde892e36fbaab0e9f8463",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "これが正義のパワー！\r\nジャスティス・ビコーの勝利だあーーーっ！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "52418232cd8f4a3f83a229ee6a956e45ef0e3297f0d8d4f71d94f09e2bdc0bac",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1054",
        "30004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d521f652599c273274acffad",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "やった、やった！やったぞ！勝ったぁっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3f988daac3483b671fdabdb15f6a76658a8f6d7491f0854c7e4f9dc4b878985e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1054",
        "30005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7ac1d28119469abdc07544d8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ヒーローの出番だな！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0f060ec773e0e2f0d608c82272464d03c4fa3418640625414ac4d1fffafad3e9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1054",
        "31000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e7a3a348d87d92327f01a562",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行くぞ！ペガサスキーック！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c34e5402522f3387241b70e5a59ee8e5cca5efd6c4826ed7f663852b081793c2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1054",
        "40000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a37c416eeb9c32f1a4a7f936",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "帮助别人是英雄的责任！\r\n所以要积极助人！\r\n这是胡萝卜超人教我的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "33182050092050a5c85d469e43b49df65d1a1fe2e88303066646aeda040be531",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1054",
        "400003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:07fcaf8ba831bab58fb44379",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "决定要做就要做到！\r\n我不会再迷惘了，\r\n因为这样才是英雄！",
      "source_fingerprint": "02ae6a2596b86df027442ea688ecb0be85cf27d7fcb9288eb8782759aa8b4c9a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1054",
        "400008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e8858d870720dc5e33c1d54d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行くぞ！ペガサスキーック！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c34e5402522f3387241b70e5a59ee8e5cca5efd6c4826ed7f663852b081793c2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1054",
        "40001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b6b538fc1e8157b79034b24c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下次换你陪我去\r\n英雄咖啡厅了！\r\n嘿嘿，我们的情谊是不灭的！喝啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0e8741b0466fc5f4a17573ce02fe85ac5666ffd991b7c42b4690f3da7787fc1f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1054",
        "400014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9f0ffc6258efa0d7780348f4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ペガサス・パーンチ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ae6dba29eced4774337dc3b7d7d4b684272149977b04b2b02cd3760a795adf4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1054",
        "40002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:857d32c960d4f55df05dd95c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ヒーローショーの始まりだぞっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8995e7491b5104c8c2dd56303f74c3d2a8631376bd50525b46c7bbf5c7cfccaa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1054",
        "60000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:580c24555a80933deb2c3e45",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "よい子のみんながアタシを呼んでる！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e589a692ba6f1545a5450af1d3d647bc8126bc055dfb399a0ddebb863b700a6e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1054",
        "60001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e1b14460a0faca05925e33ca",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一起以英雄为目标来努力吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "29061c75808db1d5da7434d00be0fdb2d1863c7c94bb93aa77061aab31535837",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1054",
        "70000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bf2ceda3cae13ac3d3c17ba8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "アタシのファンだって言ってくれた\r\nこと、すっごく嬉しかったぞ！\r\nすべてはあの日から始まったんだ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2ad7826234a9056ae709607a53b9cc26e9f568b70d0d39baaa79c306fcdea0a0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1054",
        "70001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:75a343e14ec8bd786c440291",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "胸元の飾り…\r\n変身アイテムっぽいよな！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b491ac302d9a7e5910834d945a9340e813e792055bef02f7ce7d32aababb3ad",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1054",
        "70004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0a856f91837a81a0e8ff6bcf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "お揃いの衣装で戦隊ごっこもいいな！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4bf83ad273f6e77a518fd98984e071c09caba1cba313f9556126fdaa8d213589",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
